Kamalie and native games (@ws-kamalie-games: 0, is #chapter, #part-of @workspace-development) { r_47XN2NHJR8JJGY7TJX0G4T8RHR
Owner direction, 2026-11-15. Build Kamalie first as an isolated, focused native Bevy Castle. The game is a top-down 2D dungeon crawler driven by physical things, free build composition and player experience. Runs do not preserve powerups. We author the mechanics and constrained randomness that produce places, enemies and weapons.

