## Implementation evidence

The design and atomic tasks were written before implementation. The initial native Castle is now coded under crates/interface/src/native/castles/sand/kamalie. Per owner instruction, it has not been built, run or tested. Checked atomic tasks mean code written; acceptance tasks remain open. Source evidence and deferred verification are recorded separately in the adjacent Implementation.md. The earlier architecture exploration is preserved in the host, integration and roadmap Records. It is not a statement of shipped behavior.

